"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">needs the original</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"98\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">a few features</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"110\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">of the original</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"98\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">blind: natural</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"110\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">scene statistics</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"132\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">validate against MOS (SROCC, PLCC)</text></svg>",
